<title>VENEZUELA: Venezuela bolivar ends off as TEM yields fall.</title>
<headline>Venezuela bolivar ends off as TEM yields fall.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Venezuelan bolivar closed gently off in light trade at 484.75/485.50 per dollar as yields on benchmark six month TEM paper fell 135 basis points to 22.51 percent at the Central Bank's regular Wednesday auction.</p>
<p>The bolivar closed Tuesday at 484.25/485.25 per dollar.</p>
<p>&quot;It was a very quiet, stable market today,&quot; said one trader.</p>
<p>((-- Ana Isabel Martinez, Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600))</p>
